4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jjKFAw0nmRYQ7kNvwG_zzBj&_nc_oc=AdoecTyQ45g6WtXI85QgTw_H1gG7C5PQSHURReRyY5VvJPI0UODiHCd990cxLp3pRDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMNrN9FhZb-cQj25tUvvdXmJmxK6yhPMGQ-IqLB3Qim4g&oe=6AD10794"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pZMx5-dFwJcQ7kNvwFmvfNt&_nc_oc=AdqorguPDL_ZUrXxH5ojEHzxG7bhfnXwlYintge3NMLyJ1hgQHWkbsoA5cpUJRiFfKY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOAPvuwl-ZGtsNfd4IYc6bem6t9G-bdttguZBBOabgi4A&oe=6AD0D432"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oQqHYTL7CpsQ7kNvwEE600i&_nc_oc=AdrF777X2QqXPSJpgBtW67kihkCJtP8h4_6GxRVKg-odLA3kX6fR881s3w6R_oXNfys&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNVNN6j9Mh3A1JEIhfpmRaCDBKUvbn3AgS6cf8PsWSg9Q&oe=6AD0E1D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p